2
00:12:56,000 --> 00:13:02,000
For her entire life, the cult she was born into has
been all that teenage Selah has known.

3
00:19:24,000 --> 00:19:30,000
Along with a band of similarly cloistered young women she lives seemingly unstuck in time, cut off from modern society in a remote
forest commune presided over by a man called Shepherd, a controlling, messiah-like figure with a frightening dark side.

4
00:25:52,000 --> 00:25:58,000
But when her insular world is rocked by a series of nightmarish visions and disturbing revelations, Selah begins to
question everything about her existence—including her allegiance to the increasingly dangerous Shepherd.

5
